@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Plane Management System

[*] --> Order

state "Order" as Order
state "Arrival" as Arrival
state "Preparation" as Preparation
state "Operations" as Operations
state "Maintenance" as Maintenance
state "Withdrawn from service" as WithdrawnFromService

Order --> Arrival: upon arrival of a plane
Arrival --> Preparation: upon arrival
Preparation --> (Operations or Maintenance): based on condition and schedule
Operations --> Maintenance: when no more scheduled flights or maintenance is required
Maintenance --> Preparation: after checking and servicing
(Operations or Maintenance) --> WithdrawnFromService: upon permanent withdrawal
WithdrawnFromService --> [*]

@enduml
